---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon';
---
<section class="report-container py-16 md:py-20"><div class="mb-10"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-text">The product direction</p><h2 class="text-3xl text-ink md:text-4xl">Simple enough to finish. Useful enough to keep.</h2></div><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8"><Icon name="app" size={26} /><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl text-ink">MoveUp</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-muted">A desktop application that combines the desk-height signal with local mouse and keyboard activity. It helps distinguish sitting, standing and absence, then supports better choices without moving the desk automatically.</p><p class="mt-5 border-t border-line pt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">Current evidence: application source and approved screenshots still need to be attached.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8"><Icon name="board" size={26} /><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl text-ink">The sensor</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-muted">A small USB-connected height sensor built from a microcontroller and a distance sensor. The future enclosure should be designed around measured board and connector geometry, not around a render.</p><p class="mt-5 border-t border-line pt-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">Current evidence: carrier-board review pack exists; enclosure design is not started.</p></article></div></section>
